an Yojana (PMJDY): financial inclusion, zero balance\nMudra Loan: for small businesses (Shishu-Kishore-Tarun)\nStand Up India: SC/ST and women entrepreneurs\nSukanya Samriddhi: girl child savings scheme\nKisan Credit Card: for farmers\nAtal Pension Yojana: pension for unorganized sector\nPMSBY: Pradhan Mantri Suraksha Bima Yojana (accident insurance)\nPMJJBY: Pradhan Mantri Jeevan Jyoti Bima Yojana (life insurance)\n\nBANK MERGERS (post 2019):\n• PNB + OBC + United Bank = New PNB\n• Canara Bank + Syndicate Bank\n• Union Bank + Andhra Bank + Corporation Bank\n• Indian Bank + Allahabad Bank\n• Bank of Baroda + Vijaya + Dena Bank (2019)\nNow 12 PSBs (was 27 before mergers)',
